  "job_B21.1.1.2_20251003_114521": {
    "chunk_text": "ium & o\u00ferum naman He \u00feone mig\u00f0an astyre\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 liferseocnysse & wi\u00f0 nyrwyt & wi\u00f0 swi\u00f0licne hracan genim \u00feysse wyrte to duste gecnucudre Hyt frama\u00f0. & eac hyt \u00feone inno\u00f0 wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s eallan togotenysse. Geglada\u00f0 & \u00fe\u00e6t yfel for\u00f0 gel\u00e6de\u00fe. Wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t stanas on bl\u00e6dr\u00e6n wexen genim \u00f0as sylfan wyrte strutium & lubastican wyrttruman & Hyt tolyse\u00fe \u00f0a bl\u00e6dran & \u00f0a stanas for\u00f0 gel\u00e6de\u00fe & eac \u00fe\u00e6re miltan sar hyt tolyse\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 hreoflan genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte & meluw & eced, cnuca tog\u00e6dre, lege to \u00feam hreoflan. He bi\u00f0 gelacnud. Eft \u00f0eos sylfe wyrt mid berenum meluwe on wine gesoden, ealle yfele heardnyssa & gegaderunga \u00d0eos wyrt \u00f0e is aizon & o\u00f0rum naman gecweden, seo is swylce heo symle cwycu sy, & heo hafa\u00f0 Heo bi\u00f0 cenned on dunum & heo eac by\u00fe hwilon on wealle geseted. \u00d0eos wyrt mid meoluwe gecnucud geh\u00e6le\u00fe m\u00e6nigfealde untrumnyssa \u00f0\u00e6s lichoman, \u00fe\u00e6t is Ealle \u00feas \u00feing heo geh\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 heafodece genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte wos aizon mid rosan wose gemenged, begeot \u00fe\u00e6t heafod Hyt geli\u00f0iga\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t sar. Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re n\u00e6dran slite \u00fee man spalangionem nemne\u00fe genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte aizon, syle",
